{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/unavailable

    The generic "not available" page.

    Deliberately carries nothing derived from the request: no course name, no
    identifier, no hint about why. Every value below is a fixed language string
    or the site home URL.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - Page heading.
    * message - Explanatory sentence.
    * homeurl - URL of the site home.
    * homelabel - Label of the home link.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "This content is not available",
        "message": "This page is not available for your profile.",
        "homeurl": "https://example.org/",
        "homelabel": "Home"
    }
}}
<div class="dimensions-unavailable py-5">
    <div class="dimensions-unavailable-card mx-auto p-4 p-md-5 rounded border text-center">
        <h1 class="h3 mb-3">{{heading}}</h1>
        <p class="mb-4">{{message}}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{homeurl}}">{{homelabel}}</a>
    </div>
</div>
